  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+0y+0z &=6 \\\\ 2x+0y+z &=2 \\\\ 3x+4y-2z &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299546 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6537e42b-8a1c-5a7c-a039-e705f23b1b3c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297984}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297984} :answer-field/id #uuid "33c2f659-bbef-59b6-bb94-e61266349456" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298813} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "69121421-2c36-56c2-896a-3c8729d666f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298002}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298002} :answer-field/id #uuid "3fabd7ed-2f97-51ad-824a-e556f7609e14" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298857} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fcc15c8c-b786-5904-ba29-0cac6d27cd1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298635}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298635} :answer-field/id #uuid "c35716a7-702a-5b1c-a00c-2c29a802cc9b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299292} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e9815437-135f-5aca-9a41-723aa73cac41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298545}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298545} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce25fded-a08a-58fc-9d7c-ebd368e6c675" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299326}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "e9d7caea-9c02-533d-9b0d-d992c80e7e34" :question/math-academy-id "q-316996" :question/problem "The system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y-z &=1 \\\\ y-3z &=0 \\\\ 4z &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\ncan be represented using matrix notation as\n\n|  |  | $3$ | $2$ | $-1$ |  |  |  | $x$ |  |  |  | $1$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | $1$ | {{field-2}} |  |  |  | $y$ |  | $=$ |  | $0$ |  | . |\n|  |  | $0$ | {{field-3}} | $4$ |  |  |  | $z$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that $x$, $y$, and $z$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y-z &=1 \\\\ 0x+y-3z &=0 \\\\ 0x+0y+4z &=12\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 12\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/