B$ given that\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$9$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-4}}</td><td>$14$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$5$</td><td>{{field-5}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix and $B$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $2$ columns in $A$ and $2$ rows in $B,$ so $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 2}={AB}_{4\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute the unknown elements of $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 9 \\\\ ∗ & 14 \\\\ 5 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,2=2\\cdot 1+1\\cdot 0 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ ∗ & 9 \\\\ ∗ & 14 \\\\ 5 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-1=2\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 3 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 9 \\\\ ∗ & 14 \\\\ 5 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,0=0\\cdot 1+3\\cdot 0 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 9 \\\\ -1 & 14 \\\\ 5 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-1=(-1)\\cdot 1+4\\cdot 0 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 9 \\\\ -1 & 14 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-4=5\\cdot (-2)+2\\cdot 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$$\n\\displaystyle AB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 9 \\\\ -1 & 14 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299651 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06632315-20e1-5a40-b99b-5b1bbb8afa31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297582}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297582} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f84dc72-92a1-5353-b591-bdf85d6a4d27" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299069} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "70c0bb1a-a11d-5b2a-bcd8-9f28cebb7e6f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298036}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298036} :answer-field/id #uuid "c6007ff8-9e9f-5fb3-89f5-bb5c4da4bf33" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299300}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "d6b8e49d-bc16-5e49-870a-d27907495843" :question/math-academy-id "q-317846" :question/problem "Determine $AB$ given that\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>$3$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$9$</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix and $B$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $3$ columns in $A$ and $3$ rows in $B,$ so $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 2}={AB}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute the unknown elements of $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & -8\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-3=1\\cdot 2+2\\cdot (-1)+(-1)\\cdot 3 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 3 \\\\ 9 & -8\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-8=0\\cdot 1+3\\cdot 0+4\\cdot (-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 3 \\\\ 9 & -8\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299652 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "280013db-e870-5183-9372-d816ad98f224" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297723}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297723} :answer-field/id #uuid "33eaef6a-e5d9-5210-b63a-9e30983de20d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298815} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75360412-a790-5f78-ba8d-9d3583d9e3ec" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298060}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186298060} :answer-field/id #uuid "4497312c-b639-5838-b4a9-f27d6e46fda8" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298871}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "4dabe113-4cf7-5192-92c8-d6891215d7d9" :question/math-academy-id "q-317847" :question/problem "Determine $AB$ given that\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>$4$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$0$</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix and $B$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $3$ columns in $A$ and $3$ rows in $B,$ so $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 2}={AB}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute the unknown elements of $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 4 \\\\ 0 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,5=2\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot 5 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,7=4\\cdot 2+3\\cdot 0+1\\cdot (-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}]}
